WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:06.549
So for the last couple of days, every few
hours, we have like five additional percent

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:07.549
scent

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:14.650
of the Donald Trump, Joe Biden, Ukraine withholding
aid fiasco confirmed and we're closer and

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:20.240
closer to just being able to say the entire
story as reported is true.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.530
Now, to reset the story, what we're talking
about here is a report that Donald Trump ordered

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.650
Ukraine to smear Joe Biden.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.629
If they want $250 million in military aid
plus some other rate at now it appears, uh,

00:00:34.629 --> 00:00:36.890
and otherwise they don't get it.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.761
And this was allegedly discussed during a
phone call between Donald Trump and the Ukrainian

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:42.809
president back in July.

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.059
We now know that Rudy Giuliani was pulled
in to work on this and we're talking about

00:00:47.059 --> 00:00:51.199
corruption, bribery, the term collusion is
being thrown around.

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:57.010
I mean really beyond the pale to such a degree
that even American law may be ill equipped

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:00.129
to deal with what it is that the president
is doing here.

00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:03.799
And the initial reaction from Donald Trump
was, everything's fine.

00:01:03.799 --> 00:01:08.590
Like not necessarily denying the particular
elements of the story, but saying we had a

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:11.090
totally normal, normal phone call.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:12.090
Everything's fine.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.310
The story is bogus, it's all fake news, et
cetera.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:21.740
But slowly and over the period of a couple
of days, we get confirmation of more and more

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:22.990
elements of the story.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:29.060
Donald Trump admitting sort of blurting out
really that the topic of Joe Biden did come

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:35.049
up during the July phone call with the Ukrainian
president, Donald Trump, admitting that Joe

00:01:35.049 --> 00:01:40.210
Biden being supposedly corrupt, was a topic
of conversation during the phone call.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:45.630
Donald Trump admits I did want Rudy Giuliani
involved in this entire thing.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:51.700
Generally, Rudy Giuliani with Chris Cuomo
on CNN admitting he did ask the Ukrainians

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.479
to quote, investigate Joe Biden's.

00:01:54.479 --> 00:02:00.299
So slowly but surely they deny the whole story,
but then admit to almost every single one

00:02:00.299 --> 00:02:01.479
of the component parts.

00:02:01.479 --> 00:02:06.280
Well, now we have a really big piece of this,
which is that the Washington post is broken.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:12.580
The story that indeed just days before the
July phone call between Donald Trump and the

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:17.600
Ukrainian president, Donald Trump ordered
military aid be withheld from Ukraine.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.560
Donald Trump told his acting chief of staff,
Mick Mulvaney, there's still no permanent

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:26.700
chief of staff by the way, hold back the money
just a few days before the phone call.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:31.700
According to three senior administration officials,
this was then relayed to the state department

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:32.700
and to the Pentagon.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:38.110
Now of course they're going to come up with,
and I think they already have actually some

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:43.830
innocuous benign reason for why the money
was ordered with held something like, Oh,

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.910
Trump thinks there may be better uses for
the money or something like that, but once

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:55.370
again, another element of the story is confirmed
that the timing of the money, if not the justification

00:02:55.370 --> 00:03:00.950
for the money being withheld, the timing of
the money being withheld lines up perfectly

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:07.010
with the phone call during which Donald Trump
asked Ukraine to smear Joe Biden.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.590
The story is accurate guys, the story is real.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:18.130
The story is true and this is a of four people
who are now waiting for consequences to this.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.760
Let me cut to the end of the story.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.980
There are not going to be consequences for
this.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.210
Here's how it's going to go.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:31.050
Eventually pressure will build for the transcript
of the phone call with the Ukrainian president

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.070
to be released.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:35.530
Remember that the white house has a history
of editing transcripts.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:40.120
When Donald Trump slips up and says something
stupid, so eventually the white house will

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:45.870
acquiesce or at least pretend to be acquiescing
and they will release a transcript and it

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:51.220
will either be incomplete or it won't show
an explicit quid pro quo.

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:57.270
Only an implied one and Republicans will say,
see, there's nothing to see here.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:01.870
Even if there have been other conversations
about this, which I'm sure there have been,

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:07.410
then Democrats will have to come back and
say, well listen, the quid pro quo doesn't

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:13.420
have to be explicit, but it will be just muddled
enough that nothing will happen.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.579
And Donald Trump will claim that it's just
another witch hunt.

00:04:16.579 --> 00:04:21.910
The whistleblower complaint, which is at the
heart of this entire thing will be suppressed

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.430
and then it'll be November of 2020 and people
will be voting without Donald Trump having

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:30.680
ever had to suffer any consequences as a result
of this, and I want to remind you this is,

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.290
this is like the maybe the most important
thing.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:38.290
The problem here is not the specifics of the
phone call transcript.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:44.970
The white house is suppressing a whistleblower
complaint as well as the information in that

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.060
complaint.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.410
That's the main story.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:52.460
It's not Biden, although we will debunk the
conspiracy theory around Biden a little bit

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.050
later in the show.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:58.910
It's not necessarily the transcript of this
one phone call because if this is how Donald

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:04.330
Trump is dealing with Ukraine, there is obviously
much more than just this one phone call that

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:09.120
led up to this request for from Ukraine to
Ukraine to smear Joe Biden.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:16.400
The story here is the suppression of the whistleblower,
but the Trump cronies are going to successfully

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:22.360
narrow all of this to being about the content
of one call and the transcript of that one

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.360
call.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:29.050
And by the way, in the context of the democratic
primary, this all probably helps Joe Biden

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.050
in the polls.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:36.820
I would not be surprised if next week we start
seeing polls just renewing Joe Biden's position

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:41.310
at the top and cutting the downward momentum
that he's been experiencing.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:45.300
Elizabeth Warren has had big momentum in the
last couple of months, but I predict that

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:51.260
all of this helps to maintain Joe Biden in
a solid lead in the primary.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.560
We'll we'll see when we get new polling next
week.

